    "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR removes all remaining Certification Test Plan (CTP) / Certification Requirements Document (CRD) support from the udb codebase, leaving the Portfolio abstraction in place for profile-related outputs only.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Deleted CTP/CRD backends, supporting Ruby classes/modules, schemas, and spec data (including `cert_normative_rules`).\n- Updated the udb gem API surface to remove certificate kinds/types and related architecture resolution paths.\n- Removed CI/pages pipeline references and regression jobs that generated or published CTP/CRD artifacts; updated docs accordingly.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 61 out of 64 changed files in this pull request and generated no comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| tools/test/regress-tests.yaml | Removes the certificate generation regression job source entry. |\r\n| .github/workflows/regress.yml | Removes generated CI job and dependency wiring for certificate artifact generation. |\r\n| .github/workflows/pages.yml | Stops downloading/publishing CRD/CTP PDFs to GitHub Pages. |\r\n| tools/scripts/pages.html.erb | Removes CRD/CTP sections/links from the Pages landing HTML. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/architecture.rb | Removes certificate object support from the architecture API and `$ref` resolution. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/portfolio_design.rb | Restricts portfolio design types to profiles only. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/* | Removes `CertifiableObject` integration from Extension/Instruction/CSR/CSRField. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/obj/database_obj.rb | Removes processor-certificate kinds from the Kind enum. |\r\n| spec/schemas/* | Removes `cert_normative_rules` schema definitions and references; deletes proc_cert schemas. |\r\n| spec/std/isa/* | Deletes proc_cert class/model YAMLs and strips `cert_normative_rules` from remaining ISA YAML. |\r\n| Rakefile / .pre-commit-config.yaml / .vscode/launch.json | Removes CTP/CRD tasks, hooks, and debug configs. |\r\n| tools/ruby-gems/udb/lib/udb/version.rb + Gemfile.lock(s) + sorbet RBIs | Bumps udb to 0.1.4 and updates dependent lockfiles/RBIs. |\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Files not reviewed (3)</summary>\n\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/dsl/udb/architecture.rbi**: Language not supported\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb-gen/sorbet/rbi/gems/udb@0.1.4.rbi**: Language not supported\n* **tools/ruby-gems/udb/sorbet/rbi/dsl/udb/architecture.rbi**: Language not supported\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/riscv/riscv-unified-db/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.",
